Planned additional permission
-----------------------------
An additional permission under section 7 of the AGPL for distribution
through Apple's App Store is planned. It will be added as
APP-STORE-EXCEPTION.md only after an expert review of its wording. Until
then it does not apply, and the project does not accept external
contributions (see CONTRIBUTING.md), so that the permission can later
cover the whole code base.

Third-party components
----------------------
Licenses of all third-party components are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. That file is generated by
tools/third_party_licenses.py and checked in CI.

Machine-readable license identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
